            "id": "s1:p1",
            "text": "Atrichum angustatum, commonly known as slender starburst moss, is a species of mosses belonging to the family Polytrichaceae."
          },
          {
            "id": "s1:p2",
            "text": "It is native to Eurasia and Northern America. It is rare in Iceland, being found at only two locations; there, it is locally listed as a vulnerable species (VU)."
